{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/40c6cd99b1034aa3c8df894e1454db53.avif?t=1758388296\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras_big/40c6cd99b1034aa3c8df894e1454db53.avif?t=1758388296 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diceball: Where Strategy Meets Chance in the Ultimate Tabletop Sports Showdown!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and dominate the field in Diceball, a unique turn-based sports strategy game where your management skills are just as important as your luck. Take control of one of 8 distinct teams (7 to unlock) and guide them through a challenging championship run where every roll matters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/56612310fb8ddf049776bfaebd035063.avif?t=1758388296\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras_big/56612310fb8ddf049776bfaebd035063.avif?t=1758388296 width=800 height=221 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Championship Challenge:</strong> Battle and win your way through 10 consecutive games to claim the ultimate Diceball trophy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Team Building:</strong> Visit the Concession Stand between wins to purchase powerful upgrades and consumable cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Teams: </strong>Start with the default team, the Rain Delay Bay Rookies, and win to unlock 7 more teams, each with unique starting abilities and play-styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectible Card System:</strong> Build your Card Binder with new cards unlocked throughout your various championship runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs. Reward Gameplay:</strong> Make tough decisions that could lead to glorious victory or crushing defeat! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the perfect balance of strategy and chance to become the Diceball Champion? Every game brings new challenges and opportunities in this addictive baseball management experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras/be9199c162dad4f15f8ea7b660fcac7d.avif?t=1758388296\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666980/extras_big/be9199c162dad4f15f8ea7b660fcac7d.avif?t=1758388296 width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adi\u00f3s Pelota!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3666980/8b003962ec24075e1fdbb12ff55cc7148db8aa44.jpg"},{"name":"Rookies Of The Year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3666980/a4b3e4efaf60aed60355e950e8fedacc23ad810e.jpg"},{"name":"Homeron Heroes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3666980/cf6447bea3924ce5c60e66571419ce2dde2d0178.jpg"},{"name":"Trial By Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3666980/f77d56e38df53fa0bf65d063546bf50297a35a59.jpg"},{"name":"The Slugger Circuit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3666980/203bedfc252300f2fc37e1ff79f0c1169c9b4beb.jpg"},{"name":"Valley Of Champions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3666980/45fb7c187a132d07437d851d2b9569c95c245d87.jpg"},{"name":"Round Trip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publ